| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| $J$ | $J$ | $0$ | $-y_*/2$ | $0$ |
| $J$ | $M$ | $0$ | $-126/5$ | $0$ |
| $M$ | $J$ | $0$ | $48/5-y_*$ | $0$ |
